<title>RUSSIA: Russian 1996 prelim sunflower output 2.4 mln T.</title>
<headline>Russian 1996 prelim sunflower output 2.4 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's 1996 sunflower seed output fell to 2.4 million tonnes, down from 1995's 4.0 million, according to preliminary figures released on Friday by the State Statistics Committee.  </p>
<p>The figure was below what some independent specialists had forecast.</p>
<p>--Alastair Macdonald, Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
